at":"2026-09-13T09:55:13-07:00","product_id":10484831355196,"variant_ids":[54365774348604,54365774381372,54365774414140,54365774446908,54365774479676,54365774512444,54365774545212,54365774577980],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0927\/1246\/8796\/files\/f699c427-341b-4b6f-a678-c77f83341c5d_cd2be0a3-987c-483e-9bb3-26f86fb4115a.png?v=1789318513","width":1072,"height":1072},{"id":56188516958524,"created_at":"2026-09-14T11:14:58-07:00","position":17,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T11:15:00-07:00","product_id":10484831355196,"variant_ids":[54365774872892,54365774905660,54365774938428,54365774971196,54365775003964,54365775036732,54365775069500,54365775102268],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0927\/1246\/8796\/files\/Sira_1-Nano_Banana_Pro-2026-09-14T18_13_47.png?v=1789409700","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Color","position":1,"values":["Black","Slate Grey","Burgundy","Mocha Brown","Royal Blue"]},{"name":"Size","position":2,"values":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"]}]},{"id":10483978404156,"title":"The Lipedema Handbook","handle":"the-lipedema-handbook","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eWhat nobody explained at the appointment.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lipedema Handbook is a 79-page, fifteen-chapter guide to understanding lipedema, managing it day to day, and explaining it to the people in your life. It was written for the woman who was told to eat less and move more for twenty years, and who finally has a name for her legs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvery clinical statement is checked against a named source\u003c\/strong\u003e: the 2021 US Standard of Care for Lipedema, the 2024 German clinical guideline, the Lipedema Foundation and Fat Disorders Resource Society, and peer-reviewed research through September 2026, including the first randomized trial of lipedema surgery published in The Lancet. Where the evidence is thin, the book says so. Every treatment claim carries an evidence tag.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eInside\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnderstand it.\u003c\/strong\u003e What lipedema is and is not, the four conditions it is confused with, stages and types, why it hurts, and why dieting did not fix your legs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGet a diagnosis that sticks.\u003c\/strong\u003e What clinicians check, who to see, exactly what to bring, word-for-word scripts for the appointment, and what insurers need to see in your chart.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eManage it every day.\u003c\/strong\u003e Compression pressures and knits explained, the 7 pm test, a six-station self-drainage routine with a diagram, a weekly movement plan, eating built on the only randomized diet trial, skin and pain care, a flare protocol, and the truth about hormones, metformin, and GLP-1 medications.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMedical options, honestly.\u003c\/strong\u003e Lymph-sparing liposuction with the trial data, risks in numbers, US costs, and the documentation packet built from Aetna, Anthem, and UnitedHealthcare policy language.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLive with it.\u003c\/strong\u003e Scripts for your partner, your mother, your friends, your children by age, your manager, a new doctor, and the stranger who says \"just lose weight.\" Body image, medical gaslighting, and where to find the women who already understand.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eYour first 30 days.\u003c\/strong\u003e A week-by-week plan, a one-page summary you can photograph, trackers, a glossary, and the full source list.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFormat\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDigital edition (PDF), 79 pages, US letter, readable on phone, tablet, computer, or printed. Delivered as an instant digital download.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003csmall\u003eThis guide is educational and is not medical advice. It does not diagnose and does not replace care from a clinician who has examined you. Sira Sculpt makes compression leggings; they are mentioned twice in the book, as one option in a category, and nothing in the guide requires you to buy anything.\u003c\/small\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-08T09:06:30-07:00","created_at":"2026-09-08T09:05:40-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-02T22:19:21-07:00","vendor":"Sira Sculpt","product_type":"eBook","tags":["digital","ebook","handbook","lipedema"],"variants":[{"id":54361675202876,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":false,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"24.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"39.00","position":1,"product_id":10483978404156,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:05:41-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-02T22:19:21-07:00"}],"images":[{"id":56133650940220,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:29-07:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:31-07:00","product_id":10483978404156,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0927\/1246\/8796\/files\/handbook_main.png?v=1788885331","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":56133650972988,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:29-07:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:31-07:00","product_id":10483978404156,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0927\/1246\/8796\/files\/handbook_inside.png?v=1788885331","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":56133651005756,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:29-07:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:31-07:00","product_id":10483978404156,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0927\/1246\/8796\/files\/handbook_devices.png?v=1788885331","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":56133651038524,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:29-07:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:31-07:00","product_id":10483978404156,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/fil